WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- [Kelly] Is this true,
- [Sarah] Yeah.

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:03.210
- that you and Princess Di
once dressed as policewomen?

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:05.100
Like for a, was it a bachelorette party?

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.700
- That was my hen party actually, 1986.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.550
- [Kelly] Okay, oh is that what
you call them, hen parties?

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.383
- [Sarah] Yes.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:11.442
- [Kelly] I love that, I didn't know that.

00:00:11.442 --> 00:00:12.275
- [Sarah] Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:12.275 --> 00:00:14.130
- [Kelly] I love this, so.
- But you know, we were,

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:17.250
it was extraordinary, because
we went to a nightclub.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.680
Of course you go to a nightclub
with the Princess of Wales,

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:20.790
then Princess of Wales.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:21.690
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.100
- And I was just still Fergie,

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.870
wasn't married yet, and,
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:27.210
- and we went into this
nightclub and she was in,

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.250
she was very good, as her costume.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.560
Anyway, so we sat down

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:32.917
and the waiter came up to us and said,

00:00:32.917 --> 00:00:35.970
"Excuse me, this is a member's
club and it's for fun.

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:39.030
And we don't serve police officers here."

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:40.350
Looking straight at us.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:41.183
- They thought you were
real police officers, A.

00:00:41.183 --> 00:00:42.930
- Yes, yes, yes.
- And then two,

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:44.277
they kicked police officers out?

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:45.990
- [Sarah] Yes, yes.

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:50.400
And we went out and as we came
out of the, up the stairs,

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.767
a lady was getting out
of a cab and Diana said,

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:55.020
"She's got my dress on!"

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:56.040
I said, "Dutch!"

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:56.873
I called her Dutch.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:56.873 --> 00:00:57.706
I said, "Dutch no!

00:00:57.706 --> 00:00:58.740
No, no you can't say that.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.270
We're meant to be police officers."

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:01.103
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:01.103 --> 00:01:02.100
- It was very funny and then we were -

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:03.600
- Keep in character!

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:05.793
- But Kelly, we were then arrested.

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:10.590
- I missed this story, what?

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:13.920
- We were arrested by Parks police, right?

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:15.750
So we got in the back of the van.

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:16.583
- What, what did you do to get arrested?

00:01:16.583 --> 00:01:19.170
- And she had put her engagement
ring 'round the other way.

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:20.280
And I'd put mine 'round the other way.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.050
And we were sitting in there like this

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:24.030
and she just looked around

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:26.280
and saw a smokey bacon flavored crisp

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:28.374
and started taking them and eating them.

00:01:28.374 --> 00:01:29.207
- Okay.

00:01:29.207 --> 00:01:30.397
- And the policeman in the front said,

00:01:30.397 --> 00:01:31.350
"You can't do that!"

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:32.250
We were completely -
- Just did.

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.083
- Just did.

00:01:33.083 --> 00:01:33.916
- [Kelly] Just did.

00:01:33.916 --> 00:01:35.820
- Yeah, yeah and then
eventually they realized

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:38.403
that it was, you know, Diana.

00:01:38.403 --> 00:01:39.236
- [Kelly] But, but -

00:01:39.236 --> 00:01:40.623
- And me.
- But, but, wait!

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:43.680
Why did y'all get arrested?

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:46.280
- Oh, because we were
impersonating police officers.

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:49.890
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:51.150
- But it was so funny.
- [Kelly] People are allowed

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:52.200
to be in costume.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:53.033
- Hello?

00:01:53.033 --> 00:01:53.866
- Yeah.

00:01:53.866 --> 00:01:54.699
- Anyway, but even so -

00:01:54.699 --> 00:01:55.532
- Ah, hello.

00:01:55.532 --> 00:01:57.090
- I mean, do you, yeah.

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:57.923
- I love you.

00:01:59.016 --> 00:02:00.404
- [Sarah] So funny.
- That's incredible.

00:02:00.404 --> 00:02:01.237
- [Sarah] Incredible.
- Oh my God.

00:02:01.237 --> 00:02:02.857
- And of course, everyone
always says to me,

00:02:02.857 --> 00:02:05.430
"But you must miss Dutch, you and Diana."

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:06.263
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:06.263 --> 00:02:07.096
- And I go,

00:02:07.096 --> 00:02:07.929
"No, 'cause I laugh.

00:02:07.929 --> 00:02:09.240
I mean, I'm with her,
she's with me all day."

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:11.310
I just, 'cause she's
the only one who really,

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:12.720
she and I, we laughed a lot.

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:13.553
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:13.553 --> 00:02:14.850
- We got into trouble a lot.

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:16.920
And then she used to do, you
know what she used to do?

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:20.040
She used to tell me the
worst story, joke story,

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:21.933
just before I had to be serious.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.520
So I'd go straight in to dinner and I'd,

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:27.930
and she'd always, 'cause she'd been there

00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:28.950
a few years before me.

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:29.783
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:29.783 --> 00:02:30.616
- She used to run like a gazelle

00:02:30.616 --> 00:02:32.340
to get into the dining
room quicker than me.

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:33.173
And I now, I thought,

00:02:33.173 --> 00:02:34.380
"Well that's a bit strange."

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:35.790
And when I got in, I realized why,

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:37.020
'cause she got the young people

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:38.473
and I got all the old people.

00:02:38.473 --> 00:02:40.673
- [Kelly] She, a clever one.
- [Sarah] Mhm.

